    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planned Updates</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Implementation of a character status enhancement feature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Addition of new enemy types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Expansion of the story and new stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, we plan to expand roguelike-specific elements, such as implementing a weapon collaboration feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please look forward to it!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual roguelike game where you become nanomachines to protect the human body from viruses and bacteria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time progresses, the human body ages and becomes increasingly vulnerable to viruses, bacteria, cancer cells, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/f0891abca27064526343dba293b34413.poster.avif?t=1748690017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/f0891abca27064526343dba293b34413.webm?t=1748690017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nanomachines come with a power-up feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire various weapons and eliminate external threats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viruses and bacteria become stronger over time, so strategically upgrade your weapons to stay ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/f6a269f71ba7cc4a97f30c5afca72f02.poster.avif?t=1748690017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/f6a269f71ba7cc4a97f30c5afca72f02.webm?t=1748690017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Early Access version, the number of playable units, weapon types, and stages is limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look forward to future updates, as we plan to add many new elements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/0a93357ef3f0434b1fed455e9fe01d3d.poster.avif?t=1748690017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/0a93357ef3f0434b1fed455e9fe01d3d.webm?t=1748690017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Tips:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFocus on collecting experience points first. Start by defeating enemies you can handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSurvival is key in the early game. Master the art of dodging and running away effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbLook for items on the map. Don\u2019t miss chances to heal or power up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFind weapons that suit your playstyle. Your strategy will change depending on the combinations you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone is free to stream this game, and no prior permission is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you stream the game, we\u2019ll do our best to share it as much as possible. To make it easier for us to find, please use the hashtag <strong>#VirusHunter</strong> when posting about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can notify us directly on X (Twitter) at <strong>@kenjikatou</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> The use of this game for illegal activities, unethical purposes, or anything that violates public order and morals is strictly prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Early Access Version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently available as an Early Access version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still incomplete, and various elements are planned to be expanded in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may also be bugs remaining in the game. If you come across any, we would greatly appreciate it if you could report them on the forum: <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The purchase price of the game will be gradually adjusted as new content is added and the game develops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've purchased the game, you can continue playing without any additional payments, even if the price increases in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regarding save data, we will strive to ensure it is retained. However, during the course of future updates, there may be unavoidable cases where save data cannot be carried over. We kindly ask for your understanding in advance.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual roguelike game where you become nanomachines to protect the human body from viruses and bacteria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time progresses, the human body ages and becomes increasingly vulnerable to viruses, bacteria, cancer cells, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/f0891abca27064526343dba293b34413.poster.avif?t=1748690017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/f0891abca27064526343dba293b34413.webm?t=1748690017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nanomachines come with a power-up feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire various weapons and eliminate external threats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viruses and bacteria become stronger over time, so strategically upgrade your weapons to stay ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/f6a269f71ba7cc4a97f30c5afca72f02.poster.avif?t=1748690017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/f6a269f71ba7cc4a97f30c5afca72f02.webm?t=1748690017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Early Access version, the number of playable units, weapon types, and stages is limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look forward to future updates, as we plan to add many new elements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/0a93357ef3f0434b1fed455e9fe01d3d.poster.avif?t=1748690017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/0a93357ef3f0434b1fed455e9fe01d3d.webm?t=1748690017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Tips:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFocus on collecting experience points first. Start by defeating enemies you can handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSurvival is key in the early game. Master the art of dodging and running away effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbLook for items on the map. Don\u2019t miss chances to heal or power up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFind weapons that suit your playstyle. Your strategy will change depending on the combinations you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone is free to stream this game, and no prior permission is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you stream the game, we\u2019ll do our best to share it as much as possible. To make it easier for us to find, please use the hashtag <strong>#VirusHunter</strong> when posting about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can notify us directly on X (Twitter) at <strong>@kenjikatou</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> The use of this game for illegal activities, unethical purposes, or anything that violates public order and morals is strictly prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Early Access Version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently available as an Early Access version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still incomplete, and various elements are planned to be expanded in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may also be bugs remaining in the game. If you come across any, we would greatly appreciate it if you could report them on the forum: <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The purchase price of the game will be gradually adjusted as new content is added and the game develops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've purchased the game, you can continue playing without any additional payments, even if the price increases in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regarding save data, we will strive to ensure it is retained. However, during the course of future updates, there may be unavoidable cases where save data cannot be carried over. We kindly ask for your understanding in advance.</p>",
